    "title": "Dice Puzzle - Merge puzzle",
    "description": "\u201cDice Puzzle\u201d is an addictive relaxing dice merge game. Come to play Dice Puzzle and give your brain a rest!\r\n\r\n\r\nHow to play?\r\n\t\u2043\tDrag the Dices to move them.\r\n        \u2043\tThe same Dices will be merged to a larger number Dice.\r\n\t\u2043\tThe Dices can be rotated.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\t\u2043\tBeautifully easy and simple, no pressure and no time limit.\r\n\t\u2043\tChallenging to break your highest score.\r\n\t\u2043\tEasy to play. Classic merge game for all ages!\r\n\t\u2043\tMultiple beautiful background pictures.\r\n\t\u2043\tMultiple materials of dices.  Such as: iron, crystal,  wood\u2026\r\n\r\nCome and play this game and become a master of Dice Merge Game now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u201cDice Puzzle\u201d is an addictive relaxing dice merge game. Come to play Dice Puzzle and give your brain a rest!<br><br><br>How to play?<br>\t\u2043\tDrag the Dices to move them.<br>        \u2043\tThe same Dices will be merged to a larger number Dice.<br>\t\u2043\tThe Dices can be rotated.<br><br><br>Features:<br>\t\u2043\tBeautifully easy and simple, no pressure and no time limit.<br>\t\u2043\tChallenging to break your highest score.<br>\t\u2043\tEasy to play. Classic merge game for all ages!<br>\t\u2043\tMultiple beautiful background pictures.<br>\t\u2043\tMultiple materials of dices.  Such as: iron, crystal,  wood\u2026<br><br>Come and play this game and become a master of Dice Merge Game now!",
